      ],
      "source": "https://cityofnewellenton.sc.gov/resources/ellenton-history"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Silver Bluff High School opened in 1981 as a consolidated high school for New Ellenton, Beech Island, and Jackson.",
